Native dependencies
The native dependency license report identifies the resolved crate versions
and reproduces their license text. Dependencies with MPL-2.0 terms include
cssparser 0.36.0, cssparser-macros 0.6.1, dtoa-short 0.3.5 and selectors 0.36.1.
Their corresponding source archives are available from the exact crates.io
versions recorded in native/Cargo.lock and the license report.

BoringSSL bundled by btls-sys 0.5.6
https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/btls-sys/0.5.6/download
The native TLS implementation includes the BoringSSL source shipped in this
locked crate. Its complete aggregated license is reproduced separately in
LICENSE-BORINGSSL, covering the native library in addition to the Rust wrapper.

Node.js dependencies
The package manager installs @modelcontextprotocol/sdk, Zod, better-sqlite3
and their dependency distributions with their respective licenses. The
package lock records the exact versions used for release verification.

